{"video_id":"ZpTl_uDoSsw","title":"Where thinking stops - Yngve Bakken Nilsen - NDC AI 2026","conference":"ndc","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":3165,"segments":[{"start":10.56,"duration":4.68,"text":"something um felt wrong."},{"start":17.04,"duration":5.08,"text":"I just uh I just couldn't find it."},{"start":22.64,"duration":8.64,"text":"The system worked"},{"start":26.4,"duration":4.88,"text":"and the tests passed."},{"start":31.36,"duration":7.84,"text":"features shipped."},{"start":35.12,"duration":9.36,"text":"Nothing was visibly broken"},{"start":39.2,"duration":8.8,"text":"and yet something felt incoherent."},{"start":44.48,"duration":7.04,"text":"The system no longer behaved like the"},{"start":48.0,"duration":8.08,"text":"thing that I was trying to build."},{"start":51.52,"duration":6.72,"text":"Not not incorrect, just not exactly what"},{"start":56.08,"duration":8.48,"text":"I meant."},{"start":58.24,"duration":8.88,"text":"So I I spent weeks looking for bugs,"},{"start":64.56,"duration":6.16,"text":"reviewing code,"},{"start":67.12,"duration":7.08,"text":"checking architecture,"},{"start":70.72,"duration":3.48,"text":"looking for bugs,"},{"start":74.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"thinking maybe AI is not ready for this"},{"start":77.28,"duration":5.6,"text":"quite yet."},{"start":80.0,"duration":7.4,"text":"But turned out"},{"start":82.88,"duration":4.52,"text":"the AI wasn't confused."},{"start":87.76,"duration":6.56,"text":"I was"},{"start":91.04,"duration":8.72,"text":"now this mattered to me because for the"},{"start":94.32,"duration":7.12,"text":"last 14 years I've been working in a"},{"start":99.76,"duration":4.48,"text":"enterprise"},{"start":101.44,"duration":6.72,"text":"system"},{"start":104.24,"duration":10.8,"text":"most of the time in regulated systems"},{"start":108.16,"duration":9.84,"text":"and systems where correctness matters."},{"start":115.04,"duration":5.96,"text":"systems where decisions have"},{"start":118.0,"duration":3.0,"text":"consequences"},{"start":121.28,"duration":5.44,"text":"and over that that amount of years or"},{"start":124.32,"duration":4.48,"text":"that that amount of time something"},{"start":126.72,"duration":6.12,"text":"happens."},{"start":128.8,"duration":4.04,"text":"You build intuition."},{"start":133.2,"duration":8.88,"text":"You learn what a good system looks like"},{"start":139.2,"duration":5.88,"text":"and you learn what coherent system looks"},{"start":142.08,"duration":3.0,"text":"like."},{"start":145.6,"duration":7.28,"text":"And sometimes you can't explain"},{"start":149.68,"duration":8.2,"text":"what's wrong yet,"},{"start":152.88,"duration":5.0,"text":"but you feel that something is off."},{"start":158.56,"duration":7.52,"text":"So in regulated systems,"},{"start":162.8,"duration":7.28,"text":"in regulated environments,"},{"start":166.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"assumptions matter,"},{"start":170.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"boundaries"},{"start":171.6,"duration":4.08,"text":"matter."},{"start":174.16,"duration":3.92,"text":"Sorry."},{"start":175.68,"duration":5.4,"text":"Missing decisions"},{"start":178.08,"duration":3.0,"text":"matter"},{"start":181.92,"duration":5.6,"text":"because eventually"},{"start":184.32,"duration":8.56,"text":"somebody is going to have to explain why"},{"start":187.52,"duration":8.08,"text":"the system behaved like it did."},{"start":192.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"And that is why this feeling bothered"},{"start":195.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"me."},{"start":197.84,"duration":7.16,"text":"Everything worked,"},{"start":200.24,"duration":4.76,"text":"but something didn't feel coherent."},{"start":205.04,"duration":5.28,"text":"Now, the story is"},{"start":208.24,"duration":5.52,"text":"we've been using an internal tool for"},{"start":210.32,"duration":8.0,"text":"years, uh, running retrospectives and"},{"start":213.76,"duration":8.08,"text":"workshops that I built many years ago."},{"start":218.32,"duration":6.48,"text":"And last last August, I decided it was"},{"start":221.84,"duration":6.8,"text":"time to lift this to a new and more"},{"start":224.8,"duration":6.88,"text":"improved and modern architecture"},{"start":228.64,"duration":6.4,"text":"retrospective. Fun because of course it"},{"start":231.68,"duration":5.6,"text":"can be fun, right?"},{"start":235.04,"duration":4.0,"text":"And I thought I thought let's let's do"},{"start":237.28,"duration":6.8,"text":"this now."},{"start":239.04,"duration":8.4,"text":"And this is now was supposed to be a SAS"},{"start":244.08,"duration":8.16,"text":"product for running retrospectives."},{"start":247.44,"duration":8.96,"text":"And it's built with CQRS,"},{"start":252.24,"duration":5.68,"text":"event sourcing, signal R, AI assisted"},{"start":256.4,"duration":4.0,"text":"workflows,"},{"start":257.92,"duration":5.68,"text":"semantic search,"},{"start":260.4,"duration":6.92,"text":"enterprise style architecture,"},{"start":263.6,"duration":3.72,"text":"completely overengineered,"},{"start":267.92,"duration":6.0,"text":"mainly with AI assisted development."},{"start":272.4,"duration":4.64,"text":"Now, if you've been to all of these"},{"start":273.92,"duration":6.4,"text":"talks, this is nothing new."},{"start":277.04,"duration":7.04,"text":"I built this as a side project"},{"start":280.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"and this is not a warning talk."},{"start":284.08,"duration":4.88,"text":"This is the reason why I'm standing here"},{"start":286.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"today talking to you"},{"start":288.96,"duration":8.2,"text":"because the productivity gains that I"},{"start":291.76,"duration":5.4,"text":"got, they were very real."},{"start":298.24,"duration":5.96,"text":"I only had one simple rule."},{"start":304.32,"duration":6.4,"text":"AI writes the code,"},{"start":307.36,"duration":7.2,"text":"a lot of code. AI writes all the"},{"start":310.72,"duration":6.72,"text":"features. AI writes all the tests, does"},{"start":314.56,"duration":6.76,"text":"every refactor,"},{"start":317.44,"duration":3.88,"text":"sets up all the infrastructure,"},{"start":322.48,"duration":3.64,"text":"but I make decisions."},{"start":326.64,"duration":9.12,"text":"So, I decide what we're building."},{"start":331.84,"duration":9.72,"text":"I decide what success looks like"},{"start":335.76,"duration":5.8,"text":"and I decide what constraints matter."},{"start":341.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"At least that's that was the plan."},{"start":348.0,"duration":7.76,"text":"Now most of these realizations came what"},{"start":351.84,"duration":6.96,"text":"can now be viewed as the primitive era."},{"start":355.76,"duration":7.12,"text":"August 2025"},{"start":358.8,"duration":6.8,"text":"is slightly different than June 2026"},{"start":362.88,"duration":8.08,"text":"before all these long running agent"},{"start":365.6,"duration":8.96,"text":"loops or agent orchestrations or of"},{"start":370.96,"duration":7.0,"text":"multi- or autonomous refactors,"},{"start":374.56,"duration":3.4,"text":"sub agents."},{"start":379.12,"duration":8.28,"text":"And before someone asks, yes, of course,"},{"start":381.76,"duration":5.64,"text":"the models I used are already obsolete."},{"start":387.52,"duration":5.28,"text":"But if anything,"},{"start":390.0,"duration":6.36,"text":"that actually makes this story"},{"start":392.8,"duration":3.56,"text":"even more interesting"},{"start":398.16,"duration":8.6,"text":"because the friction"},{"start":401.04,"duration":5.72,"text":"has only decreased since then."},{"start":407.84,"duration":7.52,"text":"You see, speed changes more than just"},{"start":412.4,"duration":6.48,"text":"development speed. It doesn't only make"},{"start":415.36,"duration":7.52,"text":"development faster."},{"start":418.88,"duration":8.28,"text":"It removes all the natural pauses where"},{"start":422.88,"duration":4.28,"text":"ambiguity used to surface."},{"start":427.52,"duration":6.64,"text":"In traditional development,"},{"start":430.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"developers hesitate."},{"start":434.16,"duration":5.28,"text":"Reviewers"},{"start":436.0,"duration":7.92,"text":"asks questions."},{"start":439.44,"duration":8.48,"text":"Someone says, \"Are you sure about this?\""},{"start":443.92,"duration":8.84,"text":"Or, \"I don't think I understand.\""},{"start":447.92,"duration":4.84,"text":"Or maybe, \"What's going on over here?\""},{"start":453.44,"duration":7.2,"text":"Now that friction"},{"start":456.0,"duration":6.96,"text":"was performing architectural work"},{"start":460.64,"duration":7.2,"text":"silently"},{"start":462.96,"duration":9.72,"text":"because it kept exposing decisions,"},{"start":467.84,"duration":4.84,"text":"decisions that weren't fully made yet."},{"start":472.72,"duration":10.68,"text":"And when those questions disappeared,"},{"start":478.0,"duration":5.4,"text":"well, the unfinished decisions didn't."},{"start":483.92,"duration":5.28,"text":"For instance,"},{"start":485.76,"duration":7.44,"text":"I never explicitly defined what makes"},{"start":489.2,"duration":7.2,"text":"one thing the same over time."},{"start":493.2,"duration":6.32,"text":"Was it the title?"},{"start":496.4,"duration":5.92,"text":"Maybe it was the content of the thing."},{"start":499.52,"duration":7.12,"text":"Or maybe the creator"},{"start":502.32,"duration":8.72,"text":"or maybe it was a generated identifier."},{"start":506.64,"duration":7.2,"text":"Maybe even a combination of all."},{"start":511.04,"duration":4.64,"text":"I knew in my head I had the answer all"},{"start":513.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"the time,"},{"start":515.68,"duration":6.72,"text":"but the AI didn't."},{"start":518.96,"duration":6.44,"text":"The AI implemented identity"},{"start":522.4,"duration":3.0,"text":"consistently,"},{"start":525.68,"duration":9.68,"text":"but not according to my mental model."},{"start":531.92,"duration":5.52,"text":"And the result, well, duplicate"},{"start":535.36,"duration":5.64,"text":"identities,"},{"start":537.44,"duration":3.56,"text":"broken continuity,"},{"start":541.12,"duration":9.16,"text":"technically correct behavior,"},{"start":545.12,"duration":5.16,"text":"but conceptual incoherence."},{"start":550.96,"duration":8.6,"text":"Now, the rules weren't the problem, but"},{"start":555.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"the boundary was."},{"start":559.68,"duration":7.96,"text":"Because we are surprisingly good at"},{"start":562.96,"duration":4.68,"text":"carrying boundaries around implicitly."},{"start":567.92,"duration":6.96,"text":"We know when a rule should apply."},{"start":571.6,"duration":6.96,"text":"We know when it shouldn't."},{"start":574.88,"duration":7.52,"text":"We know the exceptions."},{"start":578.56,"duration":9.32,"text":"But the AI does not."},{"start":582.4,"duration":5.48,"text":"It only sees the rule."},{"start":588.96,"duration":7.64,"text":"And here's when I started noticing the"},{"start":592.08,"duration":4.52,"text":"same pattern kind of repeating,"},{"start":596.88,"duration":3.8,"text":"missing boundaries."},{"start":602.8,"duration":6.2,"text":"Now, the AI is"},{"start":605.52,"duration":3.48,"text":"brutally honest."},{"start":609.04,"duration":7.52,"text":"Now, not because it's correct,"},{"start":613.44,"duration":6.56,"text":"and it's not brutally honest because it"},{"start":616.56,"duration":6.24,"text":"never hallucinates. We all know it does"},{"start":620.0,"duration":6.72,"text":"all the time."},{"start":622.8,"duration":6.92,"text":"But because it's a remarkably effective"},{"start":626.72,"duration":3.0,"text":"mirror,"},{"start":631.04,"duration":6.64,"text":"it reflects a structure that actually"},{"start":635.04,"duration":4.8,"text":"exists."},{"start":637.68,"duration":5.16,"text":"Doesn't reflect the structure I thought"},{"start":639.84,"duration":3.0,"text":"existed."},{"start":642.88,"duration":5.12,"text":"It reflects the decisions that I"},{"start":645.52,"duration":5.92,"text":"actually made."},{"start":648.0,"duration":7.76,"text":"not the ones I thought I made."},{"start":651.44,"duration":6.88,"text":"And it reflects the boundaries I already"},{"start":655.76,"duration":7.32,"text":"defined,"},{"start":658.32,"duration":4.76,"text":"not the ones I assumed were obvious."},{"start":663.84,"duration":6.24,"text":"Now, the AI wasn't necessarily a better"},{"start":666.56,"duration":7.52,"text":"engineer than me. Maybe it was, but it"},{"start":670.08,"duration":6.48,"text":"was a much better mirror."},{"start":674.08,"duration":6.28,"text":"So"},{"start":676.56,"duration":3.8,"text":"kept looking for bugs,"},{"start":680.4,"duration":7.84,"text":"but I couldn't find any."},{"start":684.4,"duration":7.2,"text":"And I was thinking, and at the time I"},{"start":688.24,"duration":8.08,"text":"was doing this, the most common analogy"},{"start":691.6,"duration":6.8,"text":"was, and maybe it still is, is that I"},{"start":696.32,"duration":4.64,"text":"would have a junior developer at my"},{"start":698.4,"duration":4.96,"text":"fingertips. These agents, they're like"},{"start":700.96,"duration":6.92,"text":"junior developers. spin them up. You can"},{"start":703.36,"duration":4.52,"text":"have a team of them if you want."},{"start":708.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"Um,"},{"start":710.24,"duration":7.52,"text":"I don't agree"},{"start":712.16,"duration":7.76,"text":"and I really think the analogy is wrong,"},{"start":717.76,"duration":4.88,"text":"but I also think it's could be quite"},{"start":719.92,"duration":4.96,"text":"dangerous."},{"start":722.64,"duration":4.8,"text":"I don't know about you guys, but I've"},{"start":724.88,"duration":4.24,"text":"been a junior developer. Maybe some of"},{"start":727.44,"duration":3.68,"text":"you have, too. Maybe some of you are"},{"start":729.12,"duration":4.8,"text":"junior developer right off the right off"},{"start":731.12,"duration":4.8,"text":"the school bench. And there are a couple"},{"start":733.92,"duration":4.48,"text":"of traits"},{"start":735.92,"duration":4.8,"text":"that I at least remember from when I was"},{"start":738.4,"duration":5.04,"text":"a junior developer."},{"start":740.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"I remember coming into work first day in"},{"start":743.44,"duration":5.68,"text":"a new job"},{"start":745.44,"duration":6.96,"text":"feeling a bit uncertain,"},{"start":749.12,"duration":7.6,"text":"not quite knowing why is this like this?"},{"start":752.4,"duration":8.8,"text":"Should I do this? How do I do this?"},{"start":756.72,"duration":6.16,"text":"asking the other devs for stuff"},{"start":761.2,"duration":5.12,"text":"and"},{"start":762.88,"duration":5.52,"text":"cautious because you don't want to break"},{"start":766.32,"duration":4.08,"text":"production on your first day at job at"},{"start":768.4,"duration":4.4,"text":"at a new job"},{"start":770.4,"duration":5.28,"text":"and you don't know everything. So you're"},{"start":772.8,"duration":4.88,"text":"cautious."},{"start":775.68,"duration":5.36,"text":"So you hesitate."},{"start":777.68,"duration":6.0,"text":"You spend a little more time on all the"},{"start":781.04,"duration":5.52,"text":"things that you do. Maybe you check your"},{"start":783.68,"duration":5.04,"text":"code two times, three times before"},{"start":786.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"creating that pull request or sending it"},{"start":788.72,"duration":6.84,"text":"over to the experienced senior developer"},{"start":792.0,"duration":3.56,"text":"in the other room."},{"start":796.4,"duration":5.84,"text":"And all of these things"},{"start":799.84,"duration":5.44,"text":"ultimately leads to curiosity."},{"start":802.24,"duration":5.76,"text":"You ask the questions. You sit down with"},{"start":805.28,"duration":5.2,"text":"the senior, the experienced people who"},{"start":808.0,"duration":5.6,"text":"have been working there for a long time."},{"start":810.48,"duration":6.72,"text":"How do we do this? Why does this happen?"},{"start":813.6,"duration":6.32,"text":"And how do we fix this?"},{"start":817.2,"duration":5.72,"text":"And this is a surprisingly valuable"},{"start":819.92,"duration":3.0,"text":"process"},{"start":822.96,"duration":6.0,"text":"because uncertainty"},{"start":825.92,"duration":7.44,"text":"often leads to questions."},{"start":828.96,"duration":6.48,"text":"Questions lead to better understanding"},{"start":833.36,"duration":6.44,"text":"and understanding"},{"start":835.44,"duration":4.36,"text":"ultimately leads to better decisions."},{"start":841.12,"duration":8.8,"text":"These things all surface understanding"},{"start":846.32,"duration":5.6,"text":"but in the world of AI"},{"start":849.92,"duration":4.08,"text":"it is simply"},{"start":851.92,"duration":4.0,"text":"done."},{"start":854.0,"duration":4.92,"text":"Confident"},{"start":855.92,"duration":3.0,"text":"execution."},{"start":858.96,"duration":5.36,"text":"Obviously there are ways to mitigate"},{"start":861.2,"duration":8.4,"text":"this now but they're on us. We have to"},{"start":864.32,"duration":7.44,"text":"make sure that we mitigate this because"},{"start":869.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"the hesitation"},{"start":871.76,"duration":5.76,"text":"has moved."},{"start":874.48,"duration":7.12,"text":"Now, junior developers hesitate as"},{"start":877.52,"duration":7.44,"text":"mentioned, reviewers hesitate,"},{"start":881.6,"duration":7.36,"text":"architects hesitate,"},{"start":884.96,"duration":6.88,"text":"teams hesitate."},{"start":888.96,"duration":4.96,"text":"And that is not a flaw."},{"start":891.84,"duration":3.6,"text":"That's often where the understanding"},{"start":893.92,"duration":4.08,"text":"begins."},{"start":895.44,"duration":4.96,"text":"That's where you grasp the bigger"},{"start":898.0,"duration":7.8,"text":"picture."},{"start":900.4,"duration":5.4,"text":"So the hesitation hasn't disappeared."},{"start":905.84,"duration":10.04,"text":"The questions still need answers"},{"start":910.32,"duration":5.56,"text":"and the decisions still need to be made."},{"start":917.92,"duration":6.8,"text":"So where do the decisions live?"},{"start":922.24,"duration":5.12,"text":"Well, that became one of the questions"},{"start":924.72,"duration":4.56,"text":"that I came kept coming back to in my"},{"start":927.36,"duration":4.64,"text":"project"},{"start":929.28,"duration":5.36,"text":"because every time I ran into one of"},{"start":932.0,"duration":6.8,"text":"these situations,"},{"start":934.64,"duration":7.48,"text":"the identities or the rules or the"},{"start":938.8,"duration":3.32,"text":"missing boundaries,"},{"start":943.04,"duration":5.2,"text":"I realized I wasn't actually looking at"},{"start":944.96,"duration":7.04,"text":"a coding problem anymore."},{"start":948.24,"duration":7.52,"text":"I was looking at a decision"},{"start":952.0,"duration":6.24,"text":"and eventually I realized that every"},{"start":955.76,"duration":6.6,"text":"decision seemed to be made up of at"},{"start":958.24,"duration":4.12,"text":"least three parts."},{"start":962.88,"duration":8.16,"text":"The why, not the how. How are we"},{"start":966.56,"duration":8.08,"text":"implementing this? But the why."},{"start":971.04,"duration":8.48,"text":"What are you actually trying to achieve"},{"start":974.64,"duration":9.36,"text":"and why are you trying to achieve it?"},{"start":979.52,"duration":6.8,"text":"Not implementations or classes"},{"start":984.0,"duration":4.0,"text":"or Jira tickets,"},{"start":986.32,"duration":3.2,"text":"but"},{"start":988.0,"duration":6.2,"text":"purpose"},{"start":989.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"and meaning and outcome."},{"start":994.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"Because more often than not, the com the"},{"start":996.56,"duration":4.0,"text":"implementation was completely"},{"start":998.72,"duration":4.0,"text":"reasonable."},{"start":1000.56,"duration":6.8,"text":"But I hadn't fully decided on what the"},{"start":1002.72,"duration":7.04,"text":"outcome was supposed to be."},{"start":1007.36,"duration":4.4,"text":"The AI wasn't implementing the wrong"},{"start":1009.76,"duration":4.8,"text":"thing."},{"start":1011.76,"duration":7.56,"text":"It was implementing an intent that I"},{"start":1014.56,"duration":4.76,"text":"hadn't fully described."},{"start":1019.76,"duration":6.96,"text":"But intent is obviously not enough"},{"start":1023.12,"duration":8.48,"text":"because knowing what I mean doesn't know"},{"start":1026.72,"duration":4.88,"text":"doesn't help if nobody else knows it."},{"start":1032.16,"duration":7.12,"text":"So when intent is the thing you mean"},{"start":1037.04,"duration":4.8,"text":"structure is the thing that the system"},{"start":1039.28,"duration":5.68,"text":"knows"},{"start":1041.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"not architectural di diagrams"},{"start":1044.96,"duration":5.88,"text":"not layers"},{"start":1047.52,"duration":3.32,"text":"not patterns"},{"start":1051.36,"duration":5.36,"text":"but where does this decision actually"},{"start":1054.0,"duration":6.72,"text":"exist?"},{"start":1056.72,"duration":6.0,"text":"Does it exist in code? Does it exist in"},{"start":1060.72,"duration":6.16,"text":"documentation?"},{"start":1062.72,"duration":9.56,"text":"Does it exist as an assertion in a test?"},{"start":1066.88,"duration":5.4,"text":"Or maybe it exists in a script?"},{"start":1072.48,"duration":7.52,"text":"Or does it only exist because the senior"},{"start":1075.04,"duration":7.2,"text":"engineer on the team knows about it?"},{"start":1080.0,"duration":4.8,"text":"Because if a decision only exists in my"},{"start":1082.24,"duration":6.28,"text":"head,"},{"start":1084.8,"duration":3.72,"text":"then it doesn't exist."},{"start":1089.68,"duration":7.2,"text":"But structure isn't enough either"},{"start":1093.84,"duration":7.52,"text":"because there are always decisions that"},{"start":1096.88,"duration":6.96,"text":"haven't been fully resolved yet."},{"start":1101.36,"duration":7.48,"text":"And ambiguity doesn't just disappear"},{"start":1103.84,"duration":5.0,"text":"because we've documented some of it."},{"start":1109.2,"duration":6.8,"text":"who owns the unresolved decisions."},{"start":1114.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"Now, responsibility is what happens when"},{"start":1116.0,"duration":7.52,"text":"ambiguity has nowhere left to go."},{"start":1120.0,"duration":5.44,"text":"And in human teams, in regular teams"},{"start":1123.52,"duration":5.12,"text":"without AI,"},{"start":1125.44,"duration":6.16,"text":"uncertainty, uncertainty naturally"},{"start":1128.64,"duration":6.88,"text":"escalates."},{"start":1131.6,"duration":7.6,"text":"A junior developer asks a senior."},{"start":1135.52,"duration":7.76,"text":"A senior asks an architect."},{"start":1139.2,"duration":5.92,"text":"An architect asks a product owner."},{"start":1143.28,"duration":5.4,"text":"And eventually"},{"start":1145.12,"duration":3.56,"text":"somebody decides."},{"start":1148.88,"duration":7.44,"text":"Now that social chain is carrying"},{"start":1152.4,"duration":9.04,"text":"architectural responsibility."},{"start":1156.32,"duration":8.16,"text":"AI does not participate in that chain."},{"start":1161.44,"duration":7.2,"text":"It does not stop and ask"},{"start":1164.48,"duration":7.76,"text":"should this decision exist here"},{"start":1168.64,"duration":6.88,"text":"or who owns this rule or is this"},{"start":1172.24,"duration":7.12,"text":"actually intentional."},{"start":1175.52,"duration":7.24,"text":"It doesn't ask has this constraint been"},{"start":1179.36,"duration":3.4,"text":"agreed upon."},{"start":1183.52,"duration":4.96,"text":"It simply continues execution"},{"start":1186.64,"duration":6.56,"text":"using whatever structure currently"},{"start":1188.48,"duration":8.2,"text":"exists because it is a very good pattern"},{"start":1193.2,"duration":3.48,"text":"matching machine."},{"start":1197.44,"duration":4.92,"text":"Humans naturally escalate uncertainty."},{"start":1202.48,"duration":8.4,"text":"The AI does not."},{"start":1206.24,"duration":9.68,"text":"So if the boundary is undefined,"},{"start":1210.88,"duration":9.76,"text":"well, execution continues anyway"},{"start":1215.92,"duration":7.96,"text":"because the AI cannot cross a boundary I"},{"start":1220.64,"duration":3.24,"text":"never drew."},{"start":1225.52,"duration":5.28,"text":"All right? So this problem isn't created"},{"start":1228.72,"duration":6.64,"text":"by AI."},{"start":1230.8,"duration":8.48,"text":"However, AI amplifies it."},{"start":1235.36,"duration":7.12,"text":"So missing boundaries, missing"},{"start":1239.28,"duration":7.56,"text":"decisions, missing intent,"},{"start":1242.48,"duration":4.36,"text":"structure responsibility"},{"start":1246.96,"duration":7.6,"text":"all amplified."},{"start":1249.52,"duration":8.28,"text":"So the problem doesn't disappear,"},{"start":1254.56,"duration":3.24,"text":"it accelerates."},{"start":1258.16,"duration":8.72,"text":"But again, the gains are very much real."},{"start":1264.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"My project went off on for about five"},{"start":1266.88,"duration":4.72,"text":"months."},{"start":1268.48,"duration":4.88,"text":"I was working evenings"},{"start":1271.6,"duration":4.72,"text":"the occasional"},{"start":1273.36,"duration":5.52,"text":"weekend in between dinner and homework"},{"start":1276.32,"duration":4.8,"text":"with the kids before going to bed"},{"start":1278.88,"duration":5.52,"text":"starting an agent"},{"start":1281.12,"duration":7.08,"text":"setting start creating new tasks new"},{"start":1284.4,"duration":3.8,"text":"features new bugs"},{"start":1288.88,"duration":5.52,"text":"and I closed about 865 issues during"},{"start":1292.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"that fivemonth period. Now that's not"},{"start":1294.4,"duration":4.0,"text":"that's not an impressive number,"},{"start":1296.16,"duration":4.24,"text":"especially after listening to Hullstein"},{"start":1298.4,"duration":4.4,"text":"earlier today."},{"start":1300.4,"duration":5.36,"text":"That's a month's work."},{"start":1302.8,"duration":5.84,"text":"Uh now what's important is these are not"},{"start":1305.76,"duration":6.32,"text":"automatically generated tickets or"},{"start":1308.64,"duration":5.92,"text":"issues. They were created by me. So I"},{"start":1312.08,"duration":4.72,"text":"decided what features I wanted, what"},{"start":1314.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"bugs needed to be fixed after testing"},{"start":1316.8,"duration":6.52,"text":"what the AI had built and what"},{"start":1318.88,"duration":4.44,"text":"refactorings had to be done."},{"start":1323.92,"duration":5.12,"text":"But the number itself is not what's"},{"start":1326.48,"duration":6.64,"text":"revealing."},{"start":1329.04,"duration":6.72,"text":"It's all in the details."},{"start":1333.12,"duration":7.08,"text":"So behind this number,"},{"start":1335.76,"duration":4.44,"text":"one-third features,"},{"start":1340.24,"duration":8.44,"text":"one-third bugs,"},{"start":1343.92,"duration":4.76,"text":"and one-third refactors."},{"start":1350.72,"duration":5.28,"text":"And this is me over the course of five"},{"start":1354.08,"duration":5.76,"text":"months"},{"start":1356.0,"duration":6.72,"text":"realizing my architectural decisions"},{"start":1359.84,"duration":5.76,"text":"weren't finished."},{"start":1362.72,"duration":7.64,"text":"changing direction"},{"start":1365.6,"duration":4.76,"text":"or clarifying intents"},{"start":1371.6,"duration":8.08,"text":"because the faster execution became"},{"start":1376.24,"duration":6.44,"text":"the faster the incomplete thinking"},{"start":1379.68,"duration":3.0,"text":"surfaced."},{"start":1384.88,"duration":5.68,"text":"So, one of the things that finally made"},{"start":1387.52,"duration":6.0,"text":"me realize this"},{"start":1390.56,"duration":6.8,"text":"or what was happening was started with a"},{"start":1393.52,"duration":7.76,"text":"a background job."},{"start":1397.36,"duration":6.48,"text":"So, I had a bug that I wouldn't call a"},{"start":1401.28,"duration":6.56,"text":"bug."},{"start":1403.84,"duration":6.64,"text":"I had background jobs to do email"},{"start":1407.84,"duration":6.64,"text":"retention, cleanup, all these things"},{"start":1410.48,"duration":6.8,"text":"that you do on a regular basis."},{"start":1414.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"And they were the the jobs were running"},{"start":1417.28,"duration":5.44,"text":"running just fine. Queries were"},{"start":1419.92,"duration":6.88,"text":"executing"},{"start":1422.72,"duration":7.8,"text":"and no errors were being thrown"},{"start":1426.8,"duration":3.72,"text":"but nothing happened."},{"start":1432.0,"duration":6.56,"text":"The root cause turned out to be"},{"start":1436.32,"duration":6.0,"text":"role level security."},{"start":1438.56,"duration":6.56,"text":"Now for those unfamiliar with role level"},{"start":1442.32,"duration":5.84,"text":"security, it's essentially a database"},{"start":1445.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"level access control."},{"start":1448.16,"duration":5.2,"text":"So the the database automatically"},{"start":1450.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"filters data you are not allowed to see."},{"start":1453.36,"duration":5.32,"text":"It's very common in multi-tenant"},{"start":1455.68,"duration":3.0,"text":"applications."},{"start":1458.72,"duration":6.72,"text":"So, RS worked perfectly in all my API"},{"start":1462.64,"duration":6.48,"text":"requests, returning all the data that I"},{"start":1465.44,"duration":7.04,"text":"expected when I queried my API or the"},{"start":1469.12,"duration":7.08,"text":"front p the web page queried the API"},{"start":1472.48,"duration":3.72,"text":"because it had context."},{"start":1476.32,"duration":6.64,"text":"Background jobs they ran"},{"start":1480.32,"duration":4.8,"text":"and they returned"},{"start":1482.96,"duration":4.4,"text":"and did exactly what they were supposed"},{"start":1485.12,"duration":4.24,"text":"to do."},{"start":1487.36,"duration":6.56,"text":"No errors,"},{"start":1489.36,"duration":7.36,"text":"no exceptions, no crashes."},{"start":1493.92,"duration":4.88,"text":"A lot of tests running green all the"},{"start":1496.72,"duration":5.72,"text":"time,"},{"start":1498.8,"duration":3.64,"text":"but nothing happened."},{"start":1502.64,"duration":7.68,"text":"No database"},{"start":1505.76,"duration":7.2,"text":"data meant no actions."},{"start":1510.32,"duration":5.28,"text":"And because there were no actions,"},{"start":1512.96,"duration":5.92,"text":"there was nothing to fail because the"},{"start":1515.6,"duration":5.84,"text":"background jobs didn't have the context"},{"start":1518.88,"duration":5.76,"text":"that the API had."},{"start":1521.44,"duration":7.76,"text":"So the background jobs ran. They queried"},{"start":1524.64,"duration":8.24,"text":"data without the proper RLS policy sets."},{"start":1529.2,"duration":5.84,"text":"The database returned an empty result"},{"start":1532.88,"duration":5.16,"text":"and nothing happened, but they didn't"},{"start":1535.04,"duration":3.0,"text":"fail."},{"start":1539.52,"duration":8.0,"text":"So this was not a drama dramatic bug."},{"start":1544.56,"duration":5.68,"text":"It was just missing architectural"},{"start":1547.52,"duration":6.84,"text":"context."},{"start":1550.24,"duration":4.12,"text":"Incomplete boundaries."},{"start":1555.84,"duration":9.16,"text":"A decision I thought existed,"},{"start":1559.68,"duration":5.32,"text":"but I never explicitly encoded it."},{"start":1571.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"You know that feeling,"},{"start":1574.16,"duration":5.52,"text":"the feeling of flow"},{"start":1576.64,"duration":6.56,"text":"when you just everything goes lightning"},{"start":1579.68,"duration":7.28,"text":"fast. execution"},{"start":1583.2,"duration":5.52,"text":"just the velocity of execution is just"},{"start":1586.96,"duration":5.36,"text":"incredible"},{"start":1588.72,"duration":7.28,"text":"and everything just looks amazing"},{"start":1592.32,"duration":5.2,"text":"and the PRs they fly and the tests are"},{"start":1596.0,"duration":3.28,"text":"passing"},{"start":1597.52,"duration":3.76,"text":"and implementation speed just simply"},{"start":1599.28,"duration":5.12,"text":"explodes"},{"start":1601.28,"duration":6.52,"text":"when everything feels kind of magical"},{"start":1604.4,"duration":3.4,"text":"with the AI."},{"start":1608.16,"duration":5.84,"text":"That is"},{"start":1610.08,"duration":7.44,"text":"that is what makes this difficult"},{"start":1614.0,"duration":5.52,"text":"because as I said the gains are very"},{"start":1617.52,"duration":4.72,"text":"much real"},{"start":1619.52,"duration":5.28,"text":"but my"},{"start":1622.24,"duration":7.24,"text":"most dangerous moments weren't where"},{"start":1624.8,"duration":4.68,"text":"thing when things were obviously broken."},{"start":1630.48,"duration":5.52,"text":"The most dangerous moments were when"},{"start":1632.8,"duration":5.04,"text":"everything just felt effortless,"},{"start":1636.0,"duration":4.8,"text":"magical,"},{"start":1637.84,"duration":6.08,"text":"when everything just flows"},{"start":1640.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"without effort"},{"start":1643.92,"duration":4.8,"text":"because"},{"start":1645.6,"duration":7.64,"text":"that's usually when the AI is making a"},{"start":1648.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"lot of decisions for you."},{"start":1653.84,"duration":7.04,"text":"And this is maybe the important part"},{"start":1658.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"that work"},{"start":1660.88,"duration":6.72,"text":"moves"},{"start":1663.2,"duration":8.32,"text":"because AI doesn't remove work."},{"start":1667.6,"duration":6.16,"text":"It redistributes it."},{"start":1671.52,"duration":8.48,"text":"It redistributes"},{"start":1673.76,"duration":10.32,"text":"redistributes it away from the typing,"},{"start":1680.0,"duration":8.92,"text":"away from the boiler plates."},{"start":1684.08,"duration":4.84,"text":"away from the mechanical implementation"},{"start":1689.12,"duration":6.72,"text":"toward verification"},{"start":1692.96,"duration":8.28,"text":"and comprehension"},{"start":1695.84,"duration":5.4,"text":"and architectural constraint definitions"},{"start":1701.6,"duration":4.2,"text":"and context management."},{"start":1707.52,"duration":4.48,"text":"And that's when something clicked for"},{"start":1708.96,"duration":5.52,"text":"me. And in this day and age, this is not"},{"start":1712.0,"duration":5.92,"text":"a sensational."},{"start":1714.48,"duration":7.32,"text":"But what we had automated,"},{"start":1717.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"it wasn't the hard parts,"},{"start":1721.84,"duration":8.08,"text":"it was the easy part."},{"start":1724.8,"duration":7.92,"text":"Because let's face it, writing code"},{"start":1729.92,"duration":5.8,"text":"was never the bottleneck in the first"},{"start":1732.72,"duration":3.0,"text":"place."},{"start":1735.92,"duration":7.44,"text":"comprehension was"},{"start":1739.6,"duration":7.28,"text":"and I started noticing this myself"},{"start":1743.36,"duration":8.08,"text":"because I felt faster"},{"start":1746.88,"duration":6.96,"text":"but I wasn't always understanding more."},{"start":1751.44,"duration":5.4,"text":"Sometimes I felt I was understanding"},{"start":1753.84,"duration":3.0,"text":"less"},{"start":1757.76,"duration":8.64,"text":"and found myself reviewing more code but"},{"start":1762.72,"duration":5.52,"text":"spending less time thinking about it."},{"start":1766.4,"duration":5.76,"text":"I found myself reconstructing"},{"start":1768.24,"duration":8.2,"text":"architectural decisions that I thought I"},{"start":1772.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"had already made."},{"start":1777.92,"duration":8.0,"text":"And eventually I realized"},{"start":1781.76,"duration":8.88,"text":"the speed wasn't the problem."},{"start":1785.92,"duration":8.96,"text":"Understanding was the problem."},{"start":1790.64,"duration":7.36,"text":"So what I do? Well,"},{"start":1794.88,"duration":7.44,"text":"I decided I had to start looking for"},{"start":1798.0,"duration":7.2,"text":"ways to make my thinking visible again."},{"start":1802.32,"duration":4.56,"text":"And I started with writing it down. Now,"},{"start":1805.2,"duration":4.48,"text":"I'm not talking about writing it down"},{"start":1806.88,"duration":7.52,"text":"for the AI, not prompts or instructions"},{"start":1809.68,"duration":8.72,"text":"or agents files or claw MDs or skills."},{"start":1814.4,"duration":8.08,"text":"Write it down for yourself."},{"start":1818.4,"duration":6.16,"text":"Write it down for your team"},{"start":1822.48,"duration":7.08,"text":"because something strange happens when"},{"start":1824.56,"duration":5.0,"text":"you try to write down a decision."},{"start":1829.68,"duration":8.48,"text":"All the missing decisions appear."},{"start":1833.84,"duration":8.32,"text":"Architectural assumptions appear"},{"start":1838.16,"duration":8.48,"text":"and ambiguity appears"},{"start":1842.16,"duration":7.92,"text":"and questions appears."},{"start":1846.64,"duration":6.24,"text":"Things that felt obvious in your head"},{"start":1850.08,"duration":7.12,"text":"suddenly need an explanation."},{"start":1852.88,"duration":6.4,"text":"And the moment you need to explain them,"},{"start":1857.2,"duration":6.36,"text":"that's when you often finish discover"},{"start":1859.28,"duration":4.28,"text":"that the decision wasn't finished."},{"start":1865.12,"duration":11.12,"text":"Next thing is don't rely on your memory."},{"start":1871.28,"duration":7.92,"text":"Don't rely on discipline. The we always"},{"start":1876.24,"duration":7.2,"text":"did it this way. This is how it always"},{"start":1879.2,"duration":6.64,"text":"worked. So this is this is the way"},{"start":1883.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"and count encode the structural"},{"start":1885.84,"duration":5.36,"text":"constraints"},{"start":1887.92,"duration":5.2,"text":"as boundaries."},{"start":1891.2,"duration":5.12,"text":"Now that might be architectural"},{"start":1893.12,"duration":6.16,"text":"documents, it might be tests or linting"},{"start":1896.32,"duration":6.8,"text":"rules or it might be permissions and"},{"start":1899.28,"duration":6.32,"text":"CLIs or MCPS. The point is not the"},{"start":1903.12,"duration":4.72,"text":"technology."},{"start":1905.6,"duration":5.8,"text":"The point is that the system remembers"},{"start":1907.84,"duration":3.56,"text":"it for you."},{"start":1911.92,"duration":9.04,"text":"Now some things are deterministic by"},{"start":1914.56,"duration":8.16,"text":"nature. There exists a correct answer."},{"start":1920.96,"duration":3.6,"text":"Versioning,"},{"start":1922.72,"duration":3.76,"text":"formatting,"},{"start":1924.56,"duration":3.84,"text":"change logs,"},{"start":1926.48,"duration":5.28,"text":"release notes,"},{"start":1928.4,"duration":6.88,"text":"build orchestrations."},{"start":1931.76,"duration":6.32,"text":"These aren't judgment problems. They are"},{"start":1935.28,"duration":7.2,"text":"consistency problems."},{"start":1938.08,"duration":7.6,"text":"Now we find ourselves often using deter"},{"start":1942.48,"duration":7.08,"text":"a probabilistic machine to solve"},{"start":1945.68,"duration":3.88,"text":"deterministic tasks."},{"start":1949.68,"duration":7.6,"text":"Now think about that for a second."},{"start":1952.88,"duration":7.92,"text":"We are using a system that generates"},{"start":1957.28,"duration":6.24,"text":"likely answers"},{"start":1960.8,"duration":7.0,"text":"to solve problems where we already know"},{"start":1963.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"there's one correct answer."},{"start":1968.24,"duration":6.4,"text":"That doesn't make sense."},{"start":1970.72,"duration":7.12,"text":"Deterministic works work deserves"},{"start":1974.64,"duration":5.2,"text":"deterministic systems. So write scripts"},{"start":1977.84,"duration":6.56,"text":"for the deterministic parts of your"},{"start":1979.84,"duration":7.76,"text":"workflow. For me, it was making sure the"},{"start":1984.4,"duration":5.92,"text":"build was run in a deterministic way"},{"start":1987.6,"duration":6.16,"text":"every time or that the tests were run in"},{"start":1990.32,"duration":7.6,"text":"the same way every time or that the CICD"},{"start":1993.76,"duration":6.72,"text":"pipeline works. Obviously,"},{"start":1997.92,"duration":7.36,"text":"save the probabilistic machine for the"},{"start":2000.48,"duration":7.44,"text":"problems that actually require judgment."},{"start":2005.28,"duration":5.76,"text":"But the maybe the weirdest realization"},{"start":2007.92,"duration":6.0,"text":"for me was"},{"start":2011.04,"duration":5.44,"text":"stopping."},{"start":2013.92,"duration":7.04,"text":"I'm not talking about stopping using the"},{"start":2016.48,"duration":8.64,"text":"AI as a coding assistant because it's"},{"start":2020.96,"duration":6.8,"text":"it's very very very good at that."},{"start":2025.12,"duration":5.6,"text":"But some of my best architectural"},{"start":2027.76,"duration":5.12,"text":"decisions weren't made in front of the"},{"start":2030.72,"duration":5.44,"text":"keyboard."},{"start":2032.88,"duration":6.72,"text":"Maybe that's just me, but many of my"},{"start":2036.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"best decisions were made maybe in the"},{"start":2039.6,"duration":4.96,"text":"shower"},{"start":2041.12,"duration":6.24,"text":"on my drive back from work while trying"},{"start":2044.56,"duration":6.84,"text":"to fall asleep"},{"start":2047.36,"duration":4.04,"text":"or walking to the store."},{"start":2052.96,"duration":3.96,"text":"Because preAI,"},{"start":2058.56,"duration":7.04,"text":"the workflow accidentally gave those"},{"start":2061.04,"duration":7.36,"text":"moments time to matter."},{"start":2065.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"Waiting for builds, waiting for reviews,"},{"start":2068.4,"duration":4.24,"text":"waiting for deployments. We still do"},{"start":2070.48,"duration":4.88,"text":"that, but we usually spend that time"},{"start":2072.64,"duration":5.6,"text":"spinning up another agent,"},{"start":2075.36,"duration":4.96,"text":"starting another job,"},{"start":2078.24,"duration":5.08,"text":"or talking to colleagues by the coffee"},{"start":2080.32,"duration":3.0,"text":"machine."},{"start":2083.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"The new velocity doesn't workflow"},{"start":2086.32,"duration":5.68,"text":"doesn't"},{"start":2087.92,"duration":9.04,"text":"because friction itself had value."},{"start":2092.0,"duration":7.92,"text":"Execution no longer forces reflection."},{"start":2096.96,"duration":5.96,"text":"Therefore, reflection must become"},{"start":2099.92,"duration":3.0,"text":"intentional."},{"start":2105.84,"duration":7.04,"text":"At some point I realized I was reviewing"},{"start":2109.36,"duration":6.24,"text":"code faster than I could think."},{"start":2112.88,"duration":4.4,"text":"Or maybe I just skipped reviewing code"},{"start":2115.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"altogether."},{"start":2117.28,"duration":7.6,"text":"And at that time I was starting to think"},{"start":2120.24,"duration":8.72,"text":"well am I am I being sloppy? Is this me?"},{"start":2124.88,"duration":8.52,"text":"Am I doing this wrong?"},{"start":2128.96,"duration":4.44,"text":"Maybe I'm moving too fast."},{"start":2134.56,"duration":6.72,"text":"But lately I've seen many others kind of"},{"start":2139.04,"duration":3.84,"text":"trying to describe the same kind of"},{"start":2141.28,"duration":5.76,"text":"feeling."},{"start":2142.88,"duration":6.08,"text":"And one one term"},{"start":2147.04,"duration":4.72,"text":"stood out."},{"start":2148.96,"duration":6.0,"text":"I read it from a blog post from Adios"},{"start":2151.76,"duration":6.08,"text":"Mani from Google."},{"start":2154.96,"duration":8.88,"text":"Comprehension debt."},{"start":2157.84,"duration":9.36,"text":"Now, the idea that teams ship code"},{"start":2163.84,"duration":6.48,"text":"while understanding less of the system"},{"start":2167.2,"duration":5.12,"text":"they're building."},{"start":2170.32,"duration":5.6,"text":"Now, that phrase stuck with me not"},{"start":2172.32,"duration":5.28,"text":"because it explained everything,"},{"start":2175.92,"duration":6.36,"text":"but because it described the feeling"},{"start":2177.6,"duration":4.68,"text":"that I had already experienced."},{"start":2182.72,"duration":5.4,"text":"Code your team shipped"},{"start":2188.56,"duration":5.76,"text":"but no longer fully understands."},{"start":2192.0,"duration":8.0,"text":"Now, not because developers are getting"},{"start":2194.32,"duration":7.6,"text":"worse or not because we stop caring"},{"start":2200.0,"duration":5.72,"text":"and not because they suddenly forgot how"},{"start":2201.92,"duration":3.8,"text":"to engineer software"},{"start":2206.8,"duration":7.12,"text":"because execution accelerated,"},{"start":2211.2,"duration":6.0,"text":"output exploded,"},{"start":2213.92,"duration":7.32,"text":"and friction disappeared faster than"},{"start":2217.2,"duration":4.04,"text":"comprehension could keep up."},{"start":2226.72,"duration":6.2,"text":"Now the signal was always there."},{"start":2235.2,"duration":6.84,"text":"We just had to be moving fast enough"},{"start":2238.56,"duration":3.48,"text":"to miss it."},{"start":2244.0,"duration":5.32,"text":"Now the speed"},{"start":2246.0,"duration":3.32,"text":"is real."},{"start":2249.68,"duration":6.52,"text":"The usefulness"},{"start":2251.52,"duration":4.68,"text":"is very much real."},{"start":2257.36,"duration":5.28,"text":"The productivity"},{"start":2259.6,"duration":6.08,"text":"is real."},{"start":2262.64,"duration":7.92,"text":"I actively use these tools"},{"start":2265.68,"duration":7.6,"text":"every day in a production system,"},{"start":2270.56,"duration":4.64,"text":"in enterprise systems, in regulated"},{"start":2273.28,"duration":6.72,"text":"systems."},{"start":2275.2,"duration":8.84,"text":"This is not an an anti- AI talk,"},{"start":2280.0,"duration":4.04,"text":"but I'll leave you with this."},{"start":2284.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"AI doesn't replace thinking."},{"start":2288.72,"duration":4.6,"text":"It reveals where it stopped."},{"start":2313.04,"duration":3.76,"text":"I finished a bit early, so if there's"},{"start":2314.72,"duration":4.24,"text":"questions or if you want to come and try"},{"start":2316.8,"duration":4.96,"text":"chat, feel free. I'm here or I'm"},{"start":2318.96,"duration":2.8,"text":"downstairs."}]}